percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you generate the translations it will fail if you use categories like \"app/error\". Only after one created manually the sub-folder \"app\" under the folder \"de\" (e.g. for a translation in German) the generation is successful. Otherwise it fails and the files are not generated but an exception is thrown.\n\nSeems like the sub-folders are not created correctly. Or sub-folder are not supported that way at all. But then the example in https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/blob/master/docs/guide/i18n.md should be made clearer. Because it seems to work only if one maps the category \"app/error\" to one single file \"error.php\" like in the example. \n\nHowever, below it say one should not use the filemap but rely on the standard categories!\n","closed_by":{"login":"qiangxue","id":993322,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5MzMyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/993322?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue","html_url":"https://github.com/qiangxue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"